# Fully pinned input for req2flatpak. Every version here ends up in
# python3-requirements.json with a hash, because Flathub builds offline.
#
# Pinned, not loose, for two reasons: req2flatpak refuses anything that is not
# exactly one version ("A single version number must be specified"), and an
# offline build should resolve to the same bytes every time.
#
# Direct dependencies -- the ones this app actually asks for. Everything below
# the second block is transitive and only listed because the pip install runs
# with --no-index and therefore cannot resolve anything itself.
